  "notes": [
    "Domains are producer-written values, not arbitrary poison text inserted by fault tests into unconstrained TEXT columns.",
    "Provenance is checked across its shared vocabulary; per-column locations and counts are still reported individually.",
    "Staged refs are transient: the lifecycle probe observes an actual successful cold-build INSERT rather than expecting them in a finished ready database.",
